        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Park Jin-young, Sunmi, Yubin, Yeeun, Hyerim\n- Organizations: JYP Entertainment\n- Groups: Wonder Girls\n- Products: Wonder Party\n\nFacts:\n- Wonder Girls was formed in 2006 by producer Park Jin-young under JYP Entertainment.\n- Wonder Girls debuted in 2007 as a South Korean girl group and band.\n- Sunmi, born Lee Sun-mi on May 2, 1992, is a South Korean singer.\n- Sunmi debuted in 2007 as a member of Wonder Girls.\n- Sunmi left Wonder Girls in January 2010 to pursue her academic career.\n- The final Wonder Girls line-up consisted of Yubin, Yeeun, Sunmi, and Hyerim.\n- Wonder Party is the third mini album by Wonder Girls.",
